@startuml UC14_ChallengeGym_UseCase
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Gym Challenge System" {
  (Arrive at Gym)
  (Talk to Gym Leader)
  (Receive challenge)
  (Gym Leader requirements met?)
  (Gym Leader team ready)
  (Battle Gym Leader)
  (Battle won?)
  (Defeated)
  (Victory)
  (Receive Badge)
  (Receive Prize Money)
  (Receive Blueprint/TM)
  (GymLeader defeated)
  (Update story progress)
}

Player --> (Arrive at Gym)
(Arrive at Gym) --> (Talk to Gym Leader)
(Talk to Gym Leader) --> (Receive challenge)
(Receive challenge) --> (Gym Leader requirements met?)
(Gym Leader requirements met?) --> (Gym Leader team ready)
(Gym Leader team ready) --> (Battle Gym Leader)
(Battle Gym Leader) --> (Battle won?)
(Battle won?) --> (Victory)
(Battle won?) --> (Defeated)
(Victory) --> (Receive Badge)
(Receive Badge) --> (GymLeader defeated)
(GymLeader defeated) --> (Update story progress)
(Update story progress) --> Player
(Gym Leader requirements met?) --> Player : Return later with stronger team

@enduml
